 ## Endpoints
 
-- `GET /items` → `{"items": [...]}`: every item, ordered by `id`.
+- `GET /items?limit=20&cursor=...` → `{"items": [...], "next_cursor": ...}`: items ordered by `id` in pages. `limit` is optional (1–100, default 20); supply the returned opaque `next_cursor` as `cursor` to fetch the next page. `next_cursor` is `null` on the last page. Invalid limits and cursors return 400 with `{"error": "..."}`.
 - `GET /items/<id>` → the item, 404 when unknown, 400 when `id` is not a number.
 
